{"seq":1,"slug":"desync-debugging","title":"不同步调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/practice/desync-debugging","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"不同步调试\">不同步调试</h1><p>凌晨两点，一份玩家回放在你的机器上跑到第 18324 帧突然 desync，而你手上只有一句模糊的「对不上」。确定性 bug 是所有 bug 里最难查的一类：它常常只在跨平台、跨机器、或几万帧之后才显形，无法在调试器里单步盯出来。这一篇讲一套系统化的方法——用校验和把「哪一帧、哪个对象、哪个子系统先分叉」二分定位出来，再顺藤摸回基础章那张陷阱清单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>desync 调试的核心工具是校验和（checksum / hash）：定期对模拟状态算一个摘要，比较不同机器在同一帧的摘要。因为确定性意味着两台机器在每一帧的状态应逐字节相同，它们的校验和也必须相同；第一个出现分歧的帧，就是 desync 的源头帧。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 帧两端状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t^A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t^B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，校验和函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，则要找的是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^* = \\min \\{\\, t : H(S_t^A) \\ne H(S_t^B) \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>找到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后，问题从「几万帧里某处不对」收窄成「第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 帧、推进它的那一步 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 里有非确定性」。下图是 desync 定位的工作流。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[发现 desync] --&gt; B[逐帧/周期记录状态校验和]&#10;  B --&gt; C[比对两端校验和日志]&#10;  C --&gt; D[二分找首个分歧帧 t*]&#10;  D --&gt; E[细分校验和: 按子系统/对象]&#10;  E --&gt; F[定位到具体对象/子系统]&#10;  F --&gt; G[对照非确定性来源清单]&#10;  G --&gt; H{哪一类?}&#10;  H --&gt;|浮点| I[查 FMA/fast-math]&#10;  H --&gt;|容器序| J[查遍历顺序]&#10;  H --&gt;|RNG| K[查调用序/播种]\">flowchart TD\n  A[发现 desync] --&gt; B[逐帧/周期记录状态校验和]\n  B --&gt; C[比对两端校验和日志]\n  C --&gt; D[二分找首个分歧帧 t*]\n  D --&gt; E[细分校验和: 按子系统/对象]\n  E --&gt; F[定位到具体对象/子系统]\n  F --&gt; G[对照非确定性来源清单]\n  G --&gt; H{哪一类?}\n  H --&gt;|浮点| I[查 FMA/fast-math]\n  H --&gt;|容器序| J[查遍历顺序]\n  H --&gt;|RNG| K[查调用序/播种]</pre><p>下表把校验和的不同粒度与它们各自的诊断价值列出来。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验和粒度</th>\n<th>记录什么</th>\n<th>诊断价值</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整局一次</td>\n<td>局末状态哈希</td>\n<td>只知「有没有 desync」</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每帧整体</td>\n<td>每帧全状态哈希</td>\n<td>定位首个分歧帧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每帧分子系统</td>\n<td>物理/AI/RNG 各一哈希</td>\n<td>定位到子系统</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每对象</td>\n<td>每实体状态哈希</td>\n<td>定位到具体对象</td>\n<td>高（仅调试期开）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"校验和-可复现性的度量针\">校验和：可复现性的度量针</h2><p>校验和是把「状态是否一致」这个昂贵问题压缩成「两个数字是否相等」。实现要点有三。其一，要哈希进所有「逻辑状态」——位置、速度、血量、PRNG 内部状态、实体计数器——但绝不哈希「表现状态」（粒子、插值用的渲染坐标），因为表现层允许各端不同（见 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a> 对逻辑流与表现流的区分）。其二，哈希时的遍历顺序本身要稳定（按实体 ID），否则校验和自己就不确定了，反而误报。其三，浮点状态要按二进制位哈希，而非按「看起来相等」哈希，因为 desync 往往就藏在末位。联机时各端每隔几帧把校验和发给对方（或服务器）比对，一旦发现分歧立即报告并记录上下文，这也是反作弊的一个抓手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二分定位-从几万帧到一帧\">二分定位：从几万帧到一帧</h2><p>有了每帧校验和日志，找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是一次二分。但 desync 调试的二分常常更立体。第一维是时间轴：在校验和日志里二分找首个分歧帧。第二维是子系统：把整体校验和拆成「物理哈希、AI 哈希、RNG 哈希、实体哈希」分别记录，看在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 帧是哪个子系统先分歧——若 RNG 哈希先变，说明随机调用序错位；若物理哈希先变，多半是浮点或接触点顺序。第三维是对象：在调试期开启每对象校验和，定位到具体哪个实体先偏。这套立体二分把搜索空间从「几万帧 × 整个状态」压到「一帧 × 一个子系统 × 一个对象」，剩下的就是对照 <a href=\"../foundations/sources-nondeterminism\">非确定性来源</a> 的清单逐项排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见根因与对照排查\">常见根因与对照排查</h2><p>定位到子系统后，按清单对号入座。若分歧出现在物理且随平台变化，优先查 FMA 与 fast-math（见 <a href=\"../foundations/fixed-point-vs-float\">定点数与浮点</a>）；若只在某些机器复现，多半是浮点。若分歧出现在「遍历所有实体施力/掉落」这类循环，查遍历顺序是否依赖了哈希表或指针（容器层陷阱）。若 RNG 哈希先变，查是否有「条件抽取随机数」导致两端消耗步数不同，从而序列全局错位。若分歧随机器负载变化，查是否有变步长或墙上时间渗进了逻辑（见 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop\">确定性更新循环</a>）。一个高效技巧是「单机自比对」：同一台机器跑两遍同一回放，比对两遍的校验和——若单机自己都不一致，说明有线程调度或全局状态污染，比跨平台问题更基础，先修它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把-desync-钉死在源头\">把 desync 钉死在源头</h2><p>找到根因、修复后，要防止它复发。最好的办法是把这次 desync 转成一个回归测试：保留那段触发 desync 的回放与输入流，纳入 CI，每次提交都重跑并比对校验和（详见 <a href=\"determinism-testing\">确定性测试</a>）。这样同类 bug 一旦被新代码重新引入，就会在合并前被挡下，而不是又一次在玩家的凌晨两点爆发。desync 调试与确定性测试因此是一对：调试处理已发生的，测试预防再发生的——前者的每一次胜利都应沉淀为后者的一条用例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>校验和把「状态是否一致」压缩成「两个数字是否相等」，第一个分歧帧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即 desync 源头。</li>\n<li>只哈希逻辑状态（含 PRNG），不哈希表现状态；哈希遍历序与浮点按位哈希都要稳定，否则误报。</li>\n<li>立体二分（时间 × 子系统 × 对象）把搜索空间压到一帧一子系统一对象，再对照非确定性来源清单。</li>\n<li>「单机自比对」先排除线程/全局状态污染；修复后把触发回放转成 CI 回归用例防复发。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/sources-nondeterminism\">非确定性来源</a>——定位后对照排查的根因清单。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"determinism-testing\">确定性测试</a>——把每次 desync 修复固化为回归用例。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-testing-qa/foundations/bug-lifecycle\">游戏测试 QA · Bug 生命周期</a>——desync 缺陷的跟踪与流转。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不同步调试","id":"不同步调试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"校验和：可复现性的度量针","id":"校验和-可复现性的度量针"},{"level":2,"text":"二分定位：从几万帧到一帧","id":"二分定位-从几万帧到一帧"},{"level":2,"text":"常见根因与对照排查","id":"常见根因与对照排查"},{"level":2,"text":"把 desync 钉死在源头","id":"把-desync-钉死在源头"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"回滚网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/replay-lockstep/rollback-netcode"},"next":{"title":"回放压缩与存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/practice/replay-compression-storage"}}